        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Donovan, Lewis Preston, Kevin Durant\n- Teams: Oklahoma City Thunder\n- Competitions: NBA, Western Conference, Northwest Division\n- Universities: Pennsylvania State University, Coastal Carolina University, University of Notre Dame, University of Florida\n- Products: NBA 2K13, NBA 2K15\n- Seasons: 2015–16 Oklahoma City Thunder season\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Donovan was born on May 30, 1965.\n- Lewis Preston previously served as an assistant men's basketball coach at Pennsylvania State University, Coastal Carolina University, the University of Notre Dame, and under Billy Donovan at the University of Florida.\n- Kevin Durant of the Oklahoma City Thunder was one of the three cover athletes of NBA 2K13.\n- Billy Donovan is an American professional basketball coach who is the head coach of the Oklahoma City Thunder in the National Basketball Association.\n- Kevin Durant was the solo cover athlete of NBA 2K15.\n- In the 2015–16 Oklahoma City Thunder season, the Oklahoma City Thunder won the Northwest Division and clinched the third seed in the Western Conference after just missing the playoffs the previous season.",
